Vendored third-party dependencies, built with the project (deps/CMakeLists.txt).

  minhook/   inline detour engine (BSD-2-Clause). Static library linked into WarcraftXL.dll.
  imgui/     Dear ImGui v1.91.9b (MIT): the core plus the DX9 and Win32 backends, compiled into
             WarcraftXL.dll for the overlay. The demo window is not vendored.

Nothing else is external: the client, the patcher and the proxy link the system libraries only.
